# Main Script Structure

- `main.R` should focus on workflow orchestration only:
  - setup logging and AWS credentials
  - parse CLI args
  - initialize DuckDB/data lake session
  - iterate model execution
  - write summary outputs
- Avoid embedding heavy business logic directly in `main.R`.
- Put reusable helpers in `scripts/R/ds_utils.R` or other modules.
- Use explicit, structured log messages at each major step.
